sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Sender
  participant UI as DeFi Bank UI
  participant C as ProtectedPay Contract
  participant R as Recipient
  S->>UI: Enter recipient / amount / remarks
  UI->>C: send(recipient, amount, remarks)
  C-->>UI: TransferCreated(id)
  UI-->>S: Show pending transfer + copy/QR
  R->>UI: Open Claim
  UI->>C: claim(id)
  C-->>UI: TransferClaimed(id)
  alt Not claimed
    S->>UI: Refund
    UI->>C: refund(id)
    C-->>UI: TransferRefunded(id)
  end
  UI-->>S: Auto-refresh balances & activity

